abstract: "A sharp universal 41-doubling window for nonquadratic irrational inputs in the continued-fraction B variant, and a distinct proof of finiteness and a lower bound for Giraudin’s intrinsic two-sided cap-12 invariant. Contains proofs and exact reproducibility checks."
